Backport of mupen64plus-core 3984137fc0c44110f1ef876adb008885b05a6e18
CVE-2025-9688: validate both operands before the buffer-length addition.
Only path, comment and whitespace differ from the upstream fix.

diff --git a/mupen64plus-core/src/device/cart/is_viewer.c b/mupen64plus-core/src/device/cart/is_viewer.c
index d352240..644eba7 100644
